                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.154/362: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Whitehouse</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-02T10:00:00-07:00">November 2, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>61. With reference to the Department’s instruction 145, October 15, permission
                    granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitehouse</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
